WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:02.020
Just a little further. Hang in there!

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.190
Shuuyu!

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.190
<b>The righteous.</b>

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.940
<b>For their lord,</b>

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.190
Hang in there.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.620
<b>the clouds
are destroyed.</b>

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.910
What's wrong, Shuusou?

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.210
I sense the enemy.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.480
It seems I was imagining it.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.470
Let's go.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.630
W-Wait.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.410
This "Southern Palace" that we're going to...

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.350
How far away is it?

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.740
We're almost there.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:41.520
That's the seventh time you've said that!

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:45.730
And he's handling our pursuer, right?

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.940
None can learn the location 
of the Southern Palace.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.490
We must be as careful as can be.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.860
Let's hurry.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:36.300
I'm only interested in a general named Kayuu.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:39.340
If you have him, you should 
just bring him out.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.700
You think you've won?

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:10.400
Impossible!

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:12.540
He damaged my iron ball?

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.420
You call that an iron ball? Hah!

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.840
Sure it's not made of candy?

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.580
Little brat.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:24.860
Kaan, finish him off.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.950
It'll take more than that to matter!

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.250
That ball weighs a ton to begin with.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:53.680
Add in the rotational force,

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.630
and even if there's a tiny scratch,

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.000
it's incredibly fragile!

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:02.980
He saw exactly where to strike 
that spinning iron ball?

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.640
Where'd he go?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.400
Gotcha!

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.070
Here, you forgot this!

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.130
Where am I?

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.920
What... What happened to me?

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.050
It's no good.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.900
I can't remember anything.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.060
Stop it!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.900
Let me go!

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.180
We're crossing this huge lake?

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.790
Let's hurry.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.870
Y-Yeah.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:16.560
Shuuyu, I told you not to follow him.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:18.900
Why did you do it anyway?

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:21.170
You don't know anything, do you?

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:28.160
If you don't know why 
Shuuyu did what she did,

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.280
give me that card right now.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.930
It's better for her that way.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.640
You're acting like it's my fault.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.610
You don't know her.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.610
She doesn't care what I say.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.430
I was like that before.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:50.950
I was trapped in the space of 
Reincarnation, cursing my fate...

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:55.800
I'd been rebellious toward
every lord I'd served.

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:59.080
Oh, my.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:02.040
I see my lord this time is a child?

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.810
Are you okay?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.930
I don't want your pity.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.880
Get out of here by yourself.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.690
I...

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.230
There you are.

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.480
If you're going to do it, do it quick.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:27.260
I'll be happy to be rid of her!

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:31.870
Then I'll kill you, just like you want!

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:41.780
I'm sorry I'm not a strong enough lord.

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:43.500
Why?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.880
This is the role of a lord!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.120
Pathetic!

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.240
A general, being protected by his lord!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:57.680
You're a useless coward, aren't you?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.450
Bego—

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.810
What?

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:11.110
That's when I realized I'd met 
someone I could serve with my life.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:15.530
She acted that way

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:19.040
because her link to you was still weak.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:22.290
That's probably what
Ryou'un-sama wanted to say.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.490
So this wasn't Kayuu's lord after all?

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:30.130
What is this?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.040
Did I drink too much again?

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.050
Hey,

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:38.270
one of your allies has Kayuu, right?

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.140
What's that card?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.030
And who are you?

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.180
We're back to the start again?

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.030
Fine.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:47.820
I'll take you to school.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.840
Wait!

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.700
What kind of weird fetish is this?

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.140
This is it.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:56.920
Here?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.460
This card will reveal its hidden, true form.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:08.860
What's this?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:15.470
This is the Kanteibyou,
which leads to the Southern Palace.

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:30.280
Wh-What's going on?

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.850
This is a barrier made by Suikyou-sensei.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:38.080
That explains why no one found it.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:39.560
Let's hurry.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.420
One of Hakuanshi's generals?

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.590
He'll tell them where the palace is!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.600
You hurry to the palace.

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:55.840
Shuusou...

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.840
I swear I will defeat him.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:01.850
Be careful!

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.020
Let's go, Sonshin.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:05.270
Yeah.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.280
<i>He can't keep running with that wound.</i>

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.090
<i>The blood vanishes?</i>

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.550
<i>This is the perfect place 
for an ambush, isn't it?</i>

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.010
Zanroutou!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.120
Ryou'un!

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:46.380
I'm fine.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.680
Shuusou...

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:54.820
What are you aiming at?

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:57.120
Where? Where is he?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:05.000
I won't miss next time!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.460
What? Are you just flailing wildly?

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.690
Those attacks won't hit me!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.510
There you are!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.810
I need to get back to Ryou'un-sama.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.530
Ryou'un!

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:48.020
Don't let your guard down, fool!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.540
Is the Southern Palace up ahead?

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.540
If you don't want to die, tell me.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.300
That wound on your face...

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.640
It makes you more handsome.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.510
It was wonderful,
seeing the fear on your face

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.290
when the Zanroutou hit you.

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:10.120
Just remembering it makes me laugh.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:11.980
Fine, then!

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.070
Ryou'un!

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:18.990
Ryou'un!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.900
Are you okay? Hey!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:30.000
<b>Servant</b>

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.810
A wounded princess.

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:05.510
A cursed blade.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.360
The lord stands at hell's door,

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.800
and holds the reins of the soul.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.550
Who was that girl,

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.350
glimpsed in the twilight?

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.390
Next time: "Flames."
